&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with the Partnerships BU, Build, and Data Science teams to develop the collateral, technical approach, and sales motion for an evolving product and market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch or close your first customer engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WITHIN THE FIRST YEAR, YOU&#39;LL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close and launch critical enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help set up the automotive opportunity for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale the SA function by contributing to foundational processes and content, particularly for 0-to-1 motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the trajectory of Nova by working cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, and Data Science to prioritize road map features which unblock critical accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR SKILLSET:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ Years Experience in customer facing pre- or post-sales roles, with a bias toward pre-sales, ideally in financial services, credit, or a related industry. Familiarity with indirect (dealer-financed) lending, dealer platforms (RouteOne, Dealertrack) would be a bonus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with 0-to-1 GTM motions, meaning sales motions where the product, ideal customer profile, ideal use case, and sales motion are not yet fully defined. This often looks like time at an early-stage company (seed, Series A, or Series B) or leading the 0-to-1 motion for a newly launched product at a later-stage company&lt;/li&gt;
