&lt;li&gt;Working familiarity with HTML, JavaScript, RESTful APIs, and a scripting language such as Python. You&#39;re able to read code and make light edits, without needing to be a full-stack engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UX design tools such as Figma, Adobe, or Paper&lt;/li&gt;
